<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 392 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 392 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 392 million zlotys, in nominal terms, of 91-day NBP-bills against the central bank's 300 million zloty offer, the bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available shortly.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
